        "text": "A set of non-zero vectors $\left|v_{1}\right\rangle, \ldots,\left|v_{n}\right\rangle$ are linearly dependent if there exists a set of complex numbers $a_{1}, \ldots, a_{n}$ with $a_{i} \neq 0$ for at least one value of $i$, such that

